  "description": "Microsoft SQL Server provider for ClrKernel: named, secret-free connections (Integrated Security, SQL login, or Microsoft Entra — passwords resolve from the OS credential store, never from committed files), a fluent query API over Microsoft.Data.SqlClient, SqlBulkCopy-backed bulk loads with create-from-schema, MERGE generation, and T-SQL deployment helpers (CREATE OR ALTER rewriting, GO batch splitting). Used by the #!sql cell language in ClrKernel.Language.Sql and directly from C# cells.",
